<title>USA: Wal-Mart, TeleCheck in pact.</title>
<headline>Wal-Mart, TeleCheck in pact.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wal-Mart Stores Inc said Monday TeleCheck Services Inc will provide check verification services to the retailer's 2,306 stores.</p>
<p>Terms of the pact were not disclosed.</p>
<p>TeleCheck is a unit of First Data Corp.</p>
</text>
